  reel_script omits important facts from the article: the posts/job roles list is shortened and the recruiters selecting via their managers or in person is not stated; more importantly the reel omits that the fair is conducted at the 'வேலைவாய்ப்பு மற்றும் தொழில்நெறி வழிகாட்டும் மைய வளாகம்' venue detail is simplified.
