  The article says the Namakkal Canara Bank regional chief (மண்டலத் தலைவர்) presented the cheque, but the draft's caption adds nothing wrong there; however, the slides say the cheque went to the wife, which matches. The main issue: the reel_script says the event was held at the Namakkal Canara Bank regional office, which the article states, but the slides_spec 'என்ன நடந்தது?' slide says the amount was handed over at the Namakkal Canara Bank regional office, consistent. (No substantive mismatch found in these lines.)
  The reel_script does not mention that the cheque was handed over by the Canara Bank Namakkal regional head, which is included; however it omits that the programme was organised by the Karur-Coimbatore Road branch, which is an important actor named in the article.
  The caption states the date as 17 நவம்பர் 2026 (செவ்வாய்க்கிழமை) under a date line, but the article only says செவ்வாய்க்கிழமை with no calendar date; the date line is a posting-date footer exception only if it is the posting date, and it is presented as the event day, which is an unsupported date claim.
